-- (2) Pilot Project No. 12 applies in respect of every claimant whose benefit period is established or ends in the period from December 7, 2008 to August 6, 2011 and who is ordinarily resident in a region described in Schedule I.
-- src:1461 | (2) Pilot Project No. 12 applies in respect of every claimant whose benefit period is established or ends in the period beginning on December 7, 2008 and ending on August 6, 2011 and who is ordinarily resident in a region described in Schedule I.
@ref Employment Insurance Regulations reg 77.8(2) (src:1461)
