-- Whichever of Pilot Projects No. 18, 19 and 20 governs the week (their weeks do not overlap) gives the deduction: the formula of (3) for a claimant under Part I, the formula of (4) for a self-employed person.
-- When none governs the week, NOTHING: the Act's own s 19 and s 152.18 apply (pieces ei1 and ei5).
